  "raw": " human village destroyed by fire, all victims were from Heph. That destroyed civilization as we knew it. But what do you know more\nAfter asking help from the other planets for months he sent word to me through one of my High Councilors reporting him, also requesting assistance in apprehending his father and younger brother. Once his delinquents had been caught he began construction on his defense, moving for cover. He constructed a defense system outside of town at Pegasus Farm near now deceased Fairwind. This included: Construction walls (great earth sack walls instead of doors/windows) Construction pillars (movable High Tower Defenders); Construction related to defenses - houses - walls etc; The Castle itself, suspension bridge to quest island, road to Stone Creek and park (including quarry) Construction of underground tunnels & secret doors & crawl spaces to subways within close range of Donnie castle. 410 000 mesos spent 7mn hoursConstructiontime 2:35 registrations 12948 members Create your own! No thanks Submit De",
